  <p>The request satisfies the complete intended conjunction: /dns/request?ui=, exact DNSObserver User-Agent and a 24-character Base64-compatible value.</p>
  <div class="case-foot"><span>client to synthetic server</span><span>PCAP time 1794378821.482</span><span>Expected: alert</span><span>Observed: not run</span></div>
  <dl class="facts"><div class="fact"><dt>method</dt><dd>GET</dd></div><div class="fact"><dt>host</dt><dd>redflick-test.example</dd></div><div class="fact"><dt>uri</dt><dd>/dns/request?ui=TEFCXFdTLTAxNFxhbmFseXN0</dd></div><div class="fact"><dt>response status</dt><dd>200</dd></div><div class="fact"><dt>request timestamp</dt><dd>1794378821.481821</dd></div><div class="fact"><dt>user agent</dt><dd>DNSObserver</dd></div></dl>
</article>
<article class="case" style="--role:#D65E76">
